**依据 1 · 源码核查**：[src/core/orchestrator.ts:2541-2569](https://github.com/Kanadego/dsh-heartbeat/blob/2b98572231f8b1aa852fb04a49bec477eb8e9ee5/src/core/orchestrator.ts#L2541-L2569)

